WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.137
During the Duffy Trial, Justice Vaillancourt delivered a devastating ruling.

00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:16.175
While Duffy was acquitted of all 31 counts, the judge concluded that the Senate's expense rules were impossibly vague and the Prime Minister's Office had engaged in an exercise in deception.
